sequenceDiagram

    actor U as User
    participant S as ResearchSession
    participant P as Planner
    participant O as Router
    participant X as Specialists
    participant T as Data tools
    participant W as Draft writer
    participant C as Critic
    participant R as Refiner
    U->>S: "Analyse NVDA"
    S->>S: add context + lessons
    S->>P: question + context
    P->>T: lookup_ticker("NVDA")
    T-->>P: NVDA (verified)
    P-->>O: {research_required, ticker, plan}
    O->>X: delegate_to_earnings / market / news
    X->>T: earnings, filings, technicals, macro, news
    T-->>X: JSON results (kept in GraphState.tools)
    X-->>O: findings
    O-->>W: findings + raw data
    W-->>C: first draft
    loop until PASS, 3 refinements, or gain < 0.5
        C-->>R: REVISE + issues by section
        R-->>C: revised draft + change log
    end
    C-->>S: released brief
    S->>S: cache brief, save note
    S-->>U: research brief
